CARTER MORGAN:
Today, we're talking

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:04.968
about Looker machine-learning
courses and Secop updates.

00:00:04.968 --> 00:00:07.510
I'm Carter Morgan, and welcome
to "This Week in Cloud," where

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:10.890
we serve you the
lowest-latency news.

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:14.250
Registration is now open for
Google Cloud Next, October 12

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.390
to 14.

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:17.910
Much like Google Cloud,
this year's flagship event

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:19.530
is designed to be
open and flexible,

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:20.988
and gives you the
freedom of choice

00:00:20.988 --> 00:00:22.890
to create the experience
that's best for you.

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:26.010
We've designed "Next '21" as a
customizable digital adventure

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:29.020
to allow for more
personalized journey.

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:31.960
We're releasing a new set of
features as part of Looker 21

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:34.360
that will enable organizations
to build critical data

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.187
experiences and innovative
data products faster, as well

00:00:37.187 --> 00:00:39.520
as extend their insights into
more areas of the business

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:41.260
with packaged analytics.

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:44.140
Faster application development,
more multi-cloud environment

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:46.420
support, and more accessible
insights are just a few

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:48.310
of the new offerings
of Looker 21.

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:52.670
Check out the product features
guide for full details.

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:56.050
If you couldn't attend our live
ML Academy webinar on July 22,

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:58.330
you can now watch it
on demand and take

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:01.900
advantage of free Coursera
courses on ML until August 31.

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:04.390
Prepare for the Google Cloud
Professional Machine Learning

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:06.670
Engineer Certification
exam, and show your skills

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:08.350
with badges from our
skills challenge.

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:09.820
Get started today.

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:12.490
We're thrilled to announce
Autonomic Security Operations--

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:14.440
a stack of products,
integrations, blueprints,

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:17.020
technical content, and
an accelerator program

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:18.580
to enable customers
to take advantage

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:20.500
of our best-in-class
technology stack

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:22.810
but on Chronicle and Google's
Deep Security Operations

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:24.797
Expertise.

00:01:24.797 --> 00:01:26.880
If you want to read more
about these announcements

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:29.050
